To ensure track quality, number of hit points in TPC used for reconstructing track is required to be larger than 10 (nHitsFit \(>10\)), a ratio number of hits points over number of maximum hits points are required to be larger than 0.51 and a DCA (Distance of Closest Approach) cut is required to be less than 3 cm.

